--swiftversion 6.0
--indent 4
--maxwidth 140
# `preferKeyPath` rewrites `.allSatisfy { $0 }`-shaped closures into
# `.allSatisfy(\.self)` — inside a Swift Testing `#expect(...)` macro
# expansion, that keypath form fails to type-check ("cannot infer key path
# type from context"), a real compile break this rule introduced once
# already (Phase 5). Disabled rather than hand-avoiding the pattern
# everywhere `swiftformat .` might otherwise "fix" it again.
--disable preferKeyPath
